-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P\\in V\">\\(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (forcing-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (formula-set operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\\)</span> (free-variable operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}language\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\land\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\vec\\tau(v),P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}language\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12ForcingLanguageFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\vec\\tau,P)\\leftrightarrow \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\tau))\\land\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\;\\mathrm{Name}(\\vec\\tau(v),P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A forcing-language instance is represented by an ordinary membership-language formula together with an assignment of a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-name to every free variable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"res